Z||000004||ChadMan||02-26-2001||02:10 PM||||Pretty damned hard, I would think!  <P>You might have an easier time trying to make a Tyco slot car (84 Coupe) into a fastback GT because plastic is so much easier to work with.  The slot cars are always available on eBay for $10-$25.||||reg||1
